{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642040","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1064204001:0":{"text":"俺が……勝ったのか……","source_cn":"我……打败它了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46B2B7B64B096F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064204002:1":{"text":"マイケル、アウロラ！見たか！？俺が魔物を倒したんだ！俺たちは――","source_cn":"迈克尔，奥萝菈！你们看到没？魔物消失了！我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F65A674D7373DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1064204003:0":{"text":"アインが興奮して振り返ると、そこには誰の姿もなかった……","source_cn":"埃因兴奋地回头望去，却发现身后空无一人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6314D5ADBFB96342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064204004:0":{"text":"……マイケル？アウロラ？","source_cn":"……迈克尔？奥萝菈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9304E91B9976D4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064204005:1":{"text":"二人とも……どこに隠れてんだよ！？","source_cn":"你们……你们在哪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB581C156420FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064204006:1":{"text":"