ないで……アイン。","source_cn":"别害怕……埃因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E13FEC4E0D3C578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064204012:0":{"text":"……アウロラ？","source_cn":"……奥萝菈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98CA13837272D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064204013:0":{"text":"うん、アウロラなのよ。","source_cn":"别紧张。是我，奥萝菈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x974997F0F7CCCBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064204014:0":{"text":"き……君はいったい何者なんだ？","source_cn":"你……你到底是什么人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA672232077000CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064204015:0":{"text":"大丈夫……きみを傷つけたりしないから。","source_cn":"无需担忧……我不会伤害你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DAE368DDC7B1DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064204016:1":{"text":"気づいてるかもしれないけど、わたしは夢境の導き手なのよ。ここに来たのは、きみをあの悪夢から連れ出すため……","source_cn":"也许你已经猜到，我是梦境的引路人。我来到这里，是为了引...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CEC227BD368493D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064204017:1":{"text":"悪夢……？どういうことだ？","source_cn":"噩梦……？什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D7DAB6456C9A8F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064204018:1":{"text":"長い間、きみは一つの悪夢に囚われていたのよ……","source_cn":"长久以来，你都被困在一场噩梦之中……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AFC8E077F68D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064204019:1":{"text":"戦火が渦巻く中……マイケルが死にゆく光景が、何度も繰り返されていたはずなのよ。","source_cn":"噩梦中，战火连天……迈克尔临死前的场景一次又一次重复上演……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDD3FBE53DE707E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064204020:1":{"text":"そしてきみは、そのたびに彼を支え、戦場から連れ出して、助けようとした……","source_cn":"而你，一遍遍地扶起他，想要将他带离战场，拯救他的生命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x563D6471A38284EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064204021:1":{"text":"一度たりとも、見捨てようとしたことはなかったのよ。","source_cn":"没有任何一次，你真的狠下心，抛弃他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3769D0C04CE9F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064204022:1":{"text":"でも……結局俺はマイケルを救うことができない、だろ？","source_cn":"但是……但是我没有真的救下他。对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1894661AC0B50947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064204023:1":{"text":"それどころか……そのせいで俺は両足を負傷して、二度と歩けない体になったんだ……","source_cn":"甚至……甚至我的两条腿也因此受伤，再也行动不了了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9B9DCF7DBCDB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064204024:1":{"text":"だからきみはずっと繰り返し考えていた……もしあの時、彼を救おうとしなければ、と。","source_cn":"所以，你不断地想：假如……当时没有救他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1384201CEE563584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064204025:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064204026:1":{"text":"それでもきみは優しいから、心の奥底にある光が、そんな暗い考えに抗い続けていたのよ……","source_cn":"可你是一个善良的人。在你内心深处，光辉始终抵抗着这份灰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D6373A3FEF3A4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064204027:1":{"text":"光と闇がぶつかり合う中で、影が生まれた……それこそが、ずっときみを苦しめ続け