"variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064204038:1":{"text":"でも、彼の言うことも一理ある……きみはもう、ここを出るべきなのよ。","source_cn":"不过，他说的也没错……你该离开这里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8754B9AAD139E07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064204039:1":{"text":"未来を恐れないで。きみは勇敢で優しい人だから、いつか必ず、きみの願いは叶うのよ……","source_cn":"不必为未来担忧。你是一个勇敢而善良的人，终有一日，你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7696F84A478C47FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064204040:1":{"text":"そう遠くない未来にね。","source_cn":"而那一日，已经不远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x221044CC488EBC8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064204041:1":{"text":"俺の……願い？","source_cn":"我的……心愿？什么心愿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2EA785CB6F2E243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064204042:1":{"text":"心の奥底に潜む、いちばん深い願い……その答えは、すぐに分かるはずなのよ。","source_cn":"潜藏于内心的……最深切的愿望。你很快就会得到答案。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C1B8D992BF976B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064204043:1":{"text":"だから今は……","source_cn":"至于现在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0DF75216AF2C8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064204044:1":{"text":"……素敵な朝を迎えてね。","source_cn":"去吧……迎接一个美好的清晨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7F07C248A6395DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064204045:1":{"text":"きみが、いつまでも安らかな夢を見られますように……","source_cn":"祝愿你，永远好梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C08E7C78DB6C706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:52:1064204046:1":{"text":"話し終えたその瞬間、アインの視界が闇に包まれた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BEBB6027AEAE2ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:53:1064204047:1":{"text":"記憶もまた、黒い霧に覆われたかのように次第にぼやけていく……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x349BCC32C46A71EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:54:1064204048:1":{"text":"どれほどの時間が過ぎたのか、朝の鳥のさえずりが彼を目覚めへと導いた。","source_cn":"不知多久之后，清晨的鸟鸣唤醒了他","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E5BAE29CB1C556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064204049:0":{"text":"ん……もう朝か……","source_cn":"唔……天亮了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCD87BEF5B67E3E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064204050:1":{"text":"なんか変な夢を見ていた気がする……","source_cn":"我好像做了一个奇怪的梦……梦到了什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6D34FEBBCB2D64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064204051:0":{"text":"はは……ずっと寝たきりのせいで、ついに頭もボケてきたのかな。","source_cn":"哈……是因为一直躺着，连脑子也变笨了、记忆力也变差了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE27260640434477A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064204052:0":{"text":"もし、このまま一生歩けな――","source_cn":"要是一辈子，我这双腿都——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DD3D483701784B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064204053:0":{"text":"……って、俺の足……","source_cn":"……等等，我的腿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B28A9091116FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064204054:1":{"text":"少しだけ……う、動かせるようになった！？","source_cn":"好像……好像可以挪动一点了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C516A048737D01A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064204055:1":{"text":"母さん！母さん！早く来て！足の感覚が戻ったみたいなんだ！！","source_cn":"妈！妈——！快来啊！我的腿好像有知觉了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC570094CB50B670B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃因":{"text":"アイン","source":"埃因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"アウロラ","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雄厚的声音":{"text":"重厚な声","source":"雄厚的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":56,"localized_text_count":55,"speaker_count":5}}